# TextStats

TextStats targets Python 3.11+ for a text statistics API and command-line utility. The current T-001 checkpoint supplies immutable `TextStats` values and silent whole-text `count_text` counting. File acquisition and the module CLI are later tasks. The [project brief](docs/dev/PROJECT.md) captures the full delivery boundaries; complete runnable usage instructions will be added with the documentation milestone.

Development uses [SDD Manager](SDD-MANAGER.md). See the [AI-assisted development disclosure](AI_DISCLOSURE.md).
